# Prints moved to dynamic debug by hand, from a measured kernel log.
# Input to scripts/log_demote_sites.py; each fragment names one message.
# docs/log-levels.md gives the rule these decisions apply.
#
# Measured on 0.89.89 (527AE4F8): a whole 2-node TCP suite run, and a
# 5-test workload with probes off (tests/evidence/quietlog3_0.89.89_*).

